ashwin: Quick FYI — I'm planning to switch orders-service in TF from env var secrets to projected volume via CSI/secret-provider to make rotation smoother. PR: https://github.com/redwood-inference/infra/pull/214

maria: can you paste the ExternalSecret/CSI snippet? also what's the Vault path & annotation key? @ben FYI

ben: heads-up: last time mounts changed we saw a 40s restart window on canary. add `rollingUpdate.maxUnavailable: 0` or set `maxSurge: 1` to avoid dropping pods. also ensure liveness probe is tolerant.

ashwin: snippet:
```
resource "kubernetes_deployment" "orders" {
  # ...
  spec {
    template {
      spec {
        volumes {
          name = "orders-secrets"
          projected {
            sources {
              secret {
                name = "orders-vault-secret" # backed by secrets-provider
              }
            }
          }
        }
        containers {
          name = "orders"
          volume_mounts {
            name = "orders-secrets"
            mount_path = "/etc/secrets"
            read_only = true
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

ashwin: Vault path is `secret/data/services/orders`, annotation on ExternalSecret is `redwood.com/vault-path=services/orders`. ExternalSecret CR has `refreshAfterSeconds: 45` in this PR.

maria: will projected files update on rotation without restarting pods? we rely on the CSI provider to refresh; confirm `secretProviderClass` + `refreshAfterSeconds` behavior.

ashwin: yes — CSI driver updates file contents in place; app reads from file so no restart. env var approach required restart. we added a small sidecar in the PR to `stat` the file and touch the app if needed for older apps.

ben: smoke test plan:
1) apply the ExternalSecret in staging `kubectl apply -f staging/externalsecret-orders.yaml`
2) force rotate Vault value `vault kv put secret/data/services/orders token=rotatestuff-$(date +%s)`
3) wait `kubectl exec -it orders-pod -- cat /etc/secrets/token` to assert new token
4) run `curl http://orders-staging/health` to verify no 5xx

